1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:03,097
( singing in Japanese )

2
00:00:03,097 --> 00:00:05,267
♪

3
00:00:32,707 --> 00:00:34,997
♪ PROUD OF MYSELF ♪

4
00:00:42,257 --> 00:00:44,177
♪

5
00:01:46,147 --> 00:01:46,817
( Eugeo gasps )

6
00:01:51,777 --> 00:01:54,407
Bercouli: THERE. NOW I’M READY.

7
00:01:54,407 --> 00:01:56,367
( Eugeo gasps )

8
00:01:56,367 --> 00:02:00,167
Bercouli: ALL RIGHT, KID,
BEFORE WE GET INTO IT,

9
00:02:00,167 --> 00:02:02,627
THERE’S SOMETHING
I WANNA ASK YOU.

10
00:02:02,627 --> 00:02:03,997
Eugeo: WHAT?

11
00:02:03,997 --> 00:02:06,257
Bercouli: YOU DIDN’T, YOU KNOW,

12
00:02:06,257 --> 00:02:10,587
KILL VICE COMMANDER FANATIO,
DID YOU?

13
00:02:10,587 --> 00:02:12,967
Eugeo: SHE’S ALIVE.

14
00:02:12,967 --> 00:02:15,347
SHE’S BEING HEALED AS WE SPEAK.

15
00:02:15,347 --> 00:02:16,677
( Bercouli sighs )

16
00:02:16,677 --> 00:02:17,767
THAT’S GOOD.

17
00:02:17,767 --> 00:02:19,557
SINCE YOU SPARED HER LIFE,

18
00:02:19,557 --> 00:02:22,267
I’LL RETURN THE FAVOR
AND SPARE YOURS.

19
00:02:22,267 --> 00:02:23,607
( Eugeo gasps )

20
00:02:23,607 --> 00:02:25,607
HOW DISRESPECTFUL.

21
00:02:25,607 --> 00:02:27,397
( Bercouli chuckles )

22
00:02:27,397 --> 00:02:29,397
WHY DO YOU THINK THAT?

23
00:02:29,397 --> 00:02:32,407
Eugeo: IF YOU’RE THIS HIGH UP
IN THE CATHEDRAL,

24
00:02:32,407 --> 00:02:35,407
YOU MUST BE THE COMMANDER
OF THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS.

25
00:02:35,407 --> 00:02:37,077
Bercouli: YEAH, WHAT IF I AM?

26
00:02:38,537 --> 00:02:40,157
Eugeo: WHAT ABOUT THE OTHERS?!

27
00:02:40,157 --> 00:02:42,207
FANATIO ISN’T THE ONLY KNIGHT!

28
00:02:42,207 --> 00:02:46,747
ELDRIE, THE FOUR
WHIRLING BLADES, ALICE...

29
00:02:46,747 --> 00:02:49,877
WHAT ABOUT THEM?!
DON’T THEY MATTER?!

30
00:02:49,877 --> 00:02:52,547
Bercouli: I SEE.
YOU’RE TAKING THAT ROAD.

31
00:02:52,547 --> 00:02:54,927
HOW DO I PUT THIS?

32
00:02:54,927 --> 00:02:57,177
ELDRIE IS ALICE’S APPRENTICE.

33
00:02:57,177 --> 00:02:58,717
THE FOUR WHIRLING BLADES--

34
00:02:58,717 --> 00:03:01,767
DAKIRA, JACE,
HOVEREN, AND GEERO--

35
00:03:01,767 --> 00:03:03,807
THEY’RE FANATIO’S.

36
00:03:03,807 --> 00:03:07,397
AND HER? WELL,
SHE HAPPENS TO BE MY APPRENTICE.

37
00:03:07,397 --> 00:03:10,397
IT’S NOT THAT I
DON’T CARE ABOUT THE OTHERS.

38
00:03:10,397 --> 00:03:13,907
IT’S JUST
I’M INVESTED IN FANATIO.

39
00:03:13,907 --> 00:03:17,697
THAT’S WHY, IF YOU KILLED HER,
I’D BE OBLIGED TO AVENGE HER.

40
00:03:17,697 --> 00:03:19,617
THAT’S ALL THERE IS TO IT.

41
00:03:19,617 --> 00:03:22,707
( chuckles ) THOUGH,
NOW THAT I THINK ABOUT IT,

42
00:03:22,707 --> 00:03:26,247
I GUESS LITTLE ALICE DOES
LOOK UP TO ME AS HER MENTOR.

43
00:03:26,247 --> 00:03:29,507
SHE’S NOT THE SAME
AS SHE WAS SIX YEARS AGO,

44
00:03:29,507 --> 00:03:31,967
WHEN SHE FIRST BECAME
AN APPRENTICE KNIGHT.

45
00:03:31,967 --> 00:03:34,637
IF ME AND HER WENT AT IT NOW,

46
00:03:34,637 --> 00:03:36,507
I DON’T KNOW
WHO’D COME OUT ON TOP.

47
00:03:36,507 --> 00:03:38,597
( Eugeo gasps )

48
00:03:38,597 --> 00:03:42,307
Bercouli: ANYWAY, SEEING AS HOW
ALICE IS AS STRONG AS ME,

49
00:03:42,307 --> 00:03:44,727
YOU MUST HAVE
SNUCK PAST HER SOMEHOW,

50
00:03:44,727 --> 00:03:47,727
BUT YOU WON’T BE
SO LUCKY WITH ME.

51
00:03:47,727 --> 00:03:50,857
COME TO THINK OF IT,
SHOULDN’T THERE BE TWO OF YOU?

52
00:03:50,857 --> 00:03:53,817
THE PRIME SENATOR
SAID YOU HAD A PARTNER.

53
00:03:53,817 --> 00:03:55,947
I GUESS,
IF HE’S NOT HERE WITH YOU,

54
00:03:55,947 --> 00:04:00,197
THAT MEANS HE’S OFF SOMEWHERE
KEEPING LITTLE ALICE BUSY.

55
00:04:00,197 --> 00:04:02,247
Eugeo: YEAH, HE PROBABLY IS.

56
00:04:02,247 --> 00:04:04,617
I’M READY.

57
00:04:04,617 --> 00:04:06,247
LET’S GET THIS OVER WITH.

58
00:04:06,247 --> 00:04:08,837
I’M CURIOUS TO SEE
WHO’LL AVENGE YOU.

59
00:04:08,837 --> 00:04:10,667
( Bercouli chuckles )

60
00:04:10,667 --> 00:04:14,467
NO ONE, KID.
I DON’T HAVE A MENTOR.

61
00:04:14,467 --> 00:04:16,797
♪

62
00:04:25,267 --> 00:04:27,687
Eugeo: NORKIA STYLE,
LIGHTNING SLASH.

63
00:04:27,687 --> 00:04:30,147
OR IT’S SOMETHING LIKE IT.

64
00:04:30,147 --> 00:04:32,527
WITH HIS SWORD LIKE THAT,
IT’LL TAKE HIM

65
00:04:32,527 --> 00:04:35,147
AN EXTRA MOVE OR TWO
TO ACTIVATE THE TECHNIQUE,

66
00:04:35,147 --> 00:04:38,777
BUT IF I USE
THE AINCRAD STYLE’S SONIC LEAP,

67
00:04:38,777 --> 00:04:40,157
I CAN STRIKE HIM FIRST.

68
00:04:42,447 --> 00:04:44,997
Bercouli: AH, NOW,
THAT’S AN INTERESTING STANCE.

69
00:04:44,997 --> 00:04:46,957
I’VE NEVER SEEN IT BEFORE.

70
00:04:46,957 --> 00:04:48,627
DO YOU USE COMBO ATTACKS?

71
00:04:49,747 --> 00:04:51,297
Eugeo: MAYBE I DO.

72
00:04:51,297 --> 00:04:52,417
MAYBE I DON’T.

73
00:04:52,417 --> 00:04:54,087
WHY DO YOU CARE?

74
00:04:54,087 --> 00:04:56,587
Bercouli: I DON’T. IT’S JUST
THAT THERE WAS A KNIGHT

75
00:04:56,587 --> 00:04:59,887
FROM THE DARK TERRITORY
WHO LIKED TO USE ’EM, TOO.

76
00:04:59,887 --> 00:05:02,557
I FOUGHT HIM
A COUPLE OF TIMES BEFORE.

77
00:05:02,557 --> 00:05:05,427
I DIDN’T LIKE THE EXPERIENCE,
TO BE HONEST.

78
00:05:05,427 --> 00:05:07,477
MY STYLE’S SIMPLE.

79
00:05:07,477 --> 00:05:11,187
DOING ALL THEM FLASHY MOVES
IS WAY TOO COMPLICATED.

80
00:05:11,187 --> 00:05:14,737
Eugeo: IS THAT SO? DO YOU
WANT ME TO FIGHT LIKE YOU, THEN,

81
00:05:14,737 --> 00:05:16,857
USING ONLY CONVENTIONAL MOVES?

82
00:05:16,857 --> 00:05:20,777
Bercouli: HELL, NO. YOU WANNA
USE COMBO ATTACKS, GO AHEAD.

83
00:05:20,777 --> 00:05:23,447
I CAN HANDLE
ANYTHING YOU DISH OUT, KID.

84
00:05:23,447 --> 00:05:25,657
I SHOULD WARN YOU, THOUGH,

85
00:05:25,657 --> 00:05:28,327
I’M GONNA USE
MY BEST MOVE FIRST,

86
00:05:28,327 --> 00:05:30,077
AND YOU AIN’T READY FOR IT.

87
00:05:31,417 --> 00:05:33,207
( Eugeo gasps )

88
00:05:33,207 --> 00:05:36,047
IF HIS SWORD’S
ALREADY IN PERFECT CONTROL,

89
00:05:36,047 --> 00:05:38,217
THEN I’VE ONLY GOT ONE CHANCE.

90
00:05:38,217 --> 00:05:42,597
AS HE ACTIVATES HIS MOVE,
I’LL ATTACK WITH SONIC LEAP.

91
00:05:42,597 --> 00:05:46,307
Bercouli: TASTE THE BLADE
OF BERCOULI SYNTHESIS ONE.

92
00:05:47,557 --> 00:05:49,437
EN GARDE.

93
00:05:49,437 --> 00:05:50,517
Eugeo: BERCOULI?

94
00:05:50,517 --> 00:05:51,897
♪

95
00:05:51,897 --> 00:05:53,767
( chorus vocalizing )

96
00:05:53,767 --> 00:05:54,817
( Bercouli grunts )

97
00:05:54,817 --> 00:05:56,937
( ticking clock slows )

98
00:05:56,937 --> 00:05:59,237
( Eugeo yelling )

99
00:06:01,027 --> 00:06:02,737
( ticking clock slows )

100
00:06:02,737 --> 00:06:05,577
( gasps ) THAT RIPPLE,

101
00:06:05,577 --> 00:06:07,287
IT’S WHERE HE JUST SLASHED.

102
00:06:10,327 --> 00:06:11,377
( groans )

103
00:06:19,547 --> 00:06:21,127
( gasping )

104
00:06:25,467 --> 00:06:28,057
Bercouli: OOF.
TALK ABOUT CUTTING IT CLOSE.

105
00:06:28,057 --> 00:06:29,807
THE LAST THING I EXPECTED

106
00:06:29,807 --> 00:06:33,017
WAS FOR YOU TO COME
RUSHING IN AT ME LIKE THAT.

107
00:06:33,017 --> 00:06:36,647
SORRY, KID.
I DAMN NEAR KILLED YOU.

108
00:06:36,647 --> 00:06:40,777
Eugeo: YEAH, I KNOW YOU DID,
BUT WITH WHAT?

109
00:06:40,777 --> 00:06:44,827
Bercouli: THAT WAS MY BEST MOVE,
JUST LIKE I TOLD YOU.

110
00:06:44,827 --> 00:06:48,327
WHEN I TOOK THAT SWING,
I WASN’T JUST SLICING AIR.

111
00:06:48,327 --> 00:06:52,497
I WAS SLICING A MOMENT
IN THE FUTURE, SO TO SPEAK.

112
00:06:52,497 --> 00:06:55,787
Eugeo: SLICING THE FUTURE?

113
00:06:55,787 --> 00:06:58,917
Bercouli: THE FIRST TIME I SAW
A DARK KNIGHT USE A COMBO ATTACK

114
00:06:58,917 --> 00:07:02,677
WAS JUST AFTER I BECAME
AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT MYSELF.

115
00:07:02,677 --> 00:07:06,217
THE SWORD TECHNIQUES I LEARNED
WERE ALL ABOUT PUTTING

116
00:07:06,217 --> 00:07:09,597
AS MUCH STRENGTH AS I COULD
BEHIND A SINGLE STRIKE,

117
00:07:09,597 --> 00:07:12,887
BUT SWORD TECHNIQUES
USING COMBINATION MOVES

118
00:07:12,887 --> 00:07:15,057
FOCUS ON HOW TO HANDLE
YOUR ENEMY’S ATTACKS

119
00:07:15,057 --> 00:07:17,317
AND LAND HITS.

120
00:07:17,317 --> 00:07:21,697
IT’S PRETTY OBVIOUS WHICH
IS MORE PRACTICAL IN A FIGHT.

121
00:07:21,697 --> 00:07:25,657
ANYWAY, I GOT BEAT UP REAL GOOD,
BUT I SURVIVED.

122
00:07:25,657 --> 00:07:27,277
THEN I GOT TO THINKING

123
00:07:27,277 --> 00:07:29,787
HOW I COULD LAND A HIT
AGAINST A COMBO USER.

124
00:07:31,747 --> 00:07:34,117
I FOUND THE ANSWER
WITH THIS THING.

125
00:07:34,117 --> 00:07:39,207
ORIGINALLY IT WAS PART OF
A DIVINE OBJECT CALLED A CLOCK.

126
00:07:39,207 --> 00:07:42,877
IT USED TO HANG ON THE WALL
OF THE CENTRAL CATHEDRAL.

127
00:07:42,877 --> 00:07:45,887
IT WAS HERE WHEN THE WORLD
WAS FIRST CREATED,

128
00:07:45,887 --> 00:07:47,427
OR SO I WAS TOLD.

129
00:07:49,137 --> 00:07:51,057
IT HAD A WEIRD NAME.

130
00:07:51,057 --> 00:07:53,557
THE PONTIFEX
CALLED IT "SYSTEM CLOCK"

131
00:07:53,557 --> 00:07:55,227
OR SOMETHING LIKE THAT.

132
00:07:55,227 --> 00:07:58,017
WHEN LITTLE ALICE
USES HER OSMANTHUS BLADE,

133
00:07:58,017 --> 00:08:01,147
IT CUTS THROUGH
THE HORIZONTAL AXIS OF SPACE,

134
00:08:01,147 --> 00:08:03,697
BUT MINE CUTS
THE VERTICAL AXIS OF TIME.

135
00:08:05,567 --> 00:08:07,657
NOW IT’S GOT A NEW NAME,

136
00:08:07,657 --> 00:08:09,447
THE TIME-SPLITTING SWORD.

137
00:08:10,787 --> 00:08:12,037
Eugeo: WHEN HE SWUNG IT,

138
00:08:12,037 --> 00:08:14,367
THE FORCE OF HIS STRIKE
STAYED IN PLACE.

139
00:08:14,367 --> 00:08:16,917
THAT MEANS I DON’T HAVE
A CHANCE AGAINST HIM UP CLOSE.

140
00:08:18,787 --> 00:08:20,877
I’LL HAVE TO USE
LONG-RANGE ATTACKS.

141
00:08:20,877 --> 00:08:23,667
SYSTEM CALL. CONNECT ARMAMENT.

142
00:08:23,667 --> 00:08:25,797
- SEARCH ARCHIVED MEMORY.
- Bercouli: LET ME GUESS.

143
00:08:25,797 --> 00:08:28,757
YOU’RE SETTING YOURSELF UP TO
ATTACK FROM A DISTANCE, RIGHT?

144
00:08:28,757 --> 00:08:31,927
EVERYONE WHO SEES
THAT MOVE DOES.

145
00:08:31,927 --> 00:08:34,767
SAME GOES FOR ALL
THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS

146
00:08:34,767 --> 00:08:38,147
THAT CAME AFTER ME,
INCLUDING FANATIO AND ALICE.

147
00:08:38,147 --> 00:08:39,937
ONCE THEY SAW THAT MOVE,

148
00:08:39,937 --> 00:08:41,937
THEY PICKED
LONG-RANGE PERFECT CONTROL

149
00:08:41,937 --> 00:08:43,777
TO TRY AND DEAL WITH IT.

150
00:08:43,777 --> 00:08:45,147
I CAN’T BLAME ’EM.

151
00:08:45,147 --> 00:08:46,777
TRYING TO BRING ME DOWN

152
00:08:46,777 --> 00:08:49,777
GOT TO BE SORT OF
A CONTEST BETWEEN ’EM.

153
00:08:49,777 --> 00:08:52,657
BUT I NEVER LOST.
I SPARRED WITH ALL OF ’EM,

154
00:08:52,657 --> 00:08:54,867
AND HERE I AM,
STILL THEIR COMMANDER.

155
00:08:58,207 --> 00:09:01,167
WELL, IF ONE OF ’EM
DOES TAKE MY JOB,

156
00:09:01,167 --> 00:09:03,167
IT’LL PROBABLY BE ALICE.

157
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:06,427
I SURE AM LOOKIN’ FORWARD
TO THIS, THOUGH.

158
00:09:06,427 --> 00:09:08,677
I’M CURIOUS TO SEE
WHAT KIND OF MOVES

159
00:09:08,677 --> 00:09:11,217
HELPED YOU GET PAST
ALL THOSE KNIGHTS.

160
00:09:11,217 --> 00:09:13,557
Eugeo: DON’T WORRY. YOU WILL.

161
00:09:14,927 --> 00:09:16,097
( Bercouli chuckles )

162
00:09:16,097 --> 00:09:18,437
COME AND GET IT, KID.

163
00:09:18,437 --> 00:09:21,767
THIS TIME,
I WON’T GO EASY ON YOU.

164
00:09:27,647 --> 00:09:29,867
Eugeo: ENHANCE ARMAMENT!

165
00:09:29,867 --> 00:09:32,447
♪

166
00:09:37,997 --> 00:09:38,667
( Bercouli grunts )

167
00:09:47,167 --> 00:09:48,547
( Eugeo yells )

168
00:09:48,547 --> 00:09:49,927
( Bercouli yells )

169
00:09:49,927 --> 00:09:51,177
( ticking clock slows )

170
00:09:51,177 --> 00:09:53,887
( gasps )

171
00:09:53,887 --> 00:09:56,477
( Eugeo roars )

172
00:09:58,977 --> 00:10:00,477
( Bercouli yelps )

173
00:10:04,727 --> 00:10:05,777
( Eugeo grunts )

174
00:10:05,777 --> 00:10:06,857
( ice shatters )

175
00:10:11,197 --> 00:10:12,117
( Bercouli gasps )

176
00:10:16,157 --> 00:10:17,827
CLEVER.

177
00:10:17,827 --> 00:10:19,617
( Eugeo roars )

178
00:10:21,747 --> 00:10:23,837
BLUE ROSE SWORD...

179
00:10:23,837 --> 00:10:25,797
LEND ME YOUR POWER.

180
00:10:25,797 --> 00:10:28,087
RELEASE RECOLLECTION!

181
00:10:34,757 --> 00:10:36,637
Cardinal:
NOW PAY CLOSE ATTENTION.

182
00:10:36,637 --> 00:10:39,677
THE PERFECT WEAPON CONTROL ART
HAS TWO STAGES,

183
00:10:39,677 --> 00:10:41,767
ENHANCE AND RELEASE.

184
00:10:41,767 --> 00:10:43,357
Kirito: ENHANCE?

185
00:10:43,357 --> 00:10:45,897
- Eugeo: RELEASE?
- Cardinal: YES.

186
00:10:45,897 --> 00:10:49,737
ENHANCING AWAKENS
PART OF YOUR WEAPON’S MEMORIES.

187
00:10:49,737 --> 00:10:52,987
THE ACT CAUSES
A NEW ATTACK TO MANIFEST.

188
00:10:52,987 --> 00:10:54,907
IN THE RELEASING STAGE,

189
00:10:54,907 --> 00:10:57,487
YOU CAN AWAKEN
ALL OF YOUR WEAPON’S MEMORIES.

190
00:10:57,487 --> 00:11:00,117
THEN YOU CAN UNLEASH
ITS MOST SAVAGE POWER.

191
00:11:00,117 --> 00:11:02,037
Kirito: OH. I GET IT.

192
00:11:02,037 --> 00:11:03,457
♪

193
00:11:07,957 --> 00:11:11,377
THAT EXPLAINS ELDRIE’S WHIP.
IN ITS ENHANCED STAGE,

194
00:11:11,377 --> 00:11:13,927
IT CAN GET LONGER THAN NORMAL
AND THEN SPLIT.

195
00:11:13,927 --> 00:11:16,137
♪

196
00:11:18,887 --> 00:11:20,767
Eugeo: THEN ITS RELEASE STAGE

197
00:11:20,767 --> 00:11:22,807
WAS WHEN IT CHANGED
INTO A SNAKE.

198
00:11:22,807 --> 00:11:25,267
Cardinal: YOU ARE CORRECT.
THAT SAID,

199
00:11:25,267 --> 00:11:28,277
YOU TWO SHOULD AVOID USING
RELEASE FOR THE TIME BEING.

200
00:11:28,277 --> 00:11:30,397
Eugeo: WH-WHY SHOULD WE?

201
00:11:30,397 --> 00:11:32,777
Cardinal: BECAUSE YOU ARE
NOT YET READY TO.

202
00:11:32,777 --> 00:11:35,277
YOU HAVE ONLY
JUST LEARNED OF THE ART.

203
00:11:35,277 --> 00:11:37,907
UNTIL YOU MASTER IT,
YOU CANNOT CONTROL

204
00:11:37,907 --> 00:11:40,577
THE POWER GENERATED
BY YOUR WEAPON’S MEMORIES,

205
00:11:40,577 --> 00:11:44,037
ESPECIALLY THOSE
OF A DIVINE OBJECT LIKE YOURS.

206
00:11:44,037 --> 00:11:46,957
IT CAN HARM YOU
AS MUCH AS YOUR ENEMY.

207
00:11:46,957 --> 00:11:51,007
IF YOU’RE NOT CAREFUL,
IT WILL KILL YOU.

208
00:11:51,007 --> 00:11:52,667
( ice crackling )

209
00:11:57,097 --> 00:11:58,307
( Eugeo chuckles )

210
00:11:58,307 --> 00:12:00,517
( Bercouli gasps, chuckles )

211
00:12:00,517 --> 00:12:05,017
I NEVER SAW A SWORDSMAN TOSS
HIS BLADE DURING A FIGHT BEFORE.

212
00:12:05,017 --> 00:12:07,647
DID YOU COME UP
WITH THAT TRICK YOURSELF?

213
00:12:07,647 --> 00:12:10,977
Eugeo: UH-UH.
MY PARTNER TAUGHT ME THAT ONE.

214
00:12:10,977 --> 00:12:14,107
THE BATTLEFIELD
HAS LOTS OF OPPORTUNITIES.

215
00:12:14,107 --> 00:12:16,317
ANYTHING CAN BE
A WEAPON OR A TRAP.

216
00:12:16,317 --> 00:12:17,527
( Bercouli chuckles )

217
00:12:17,527 --> 00:12:20,947
MAKE THE BEST
OF WHAT YOU GOT. SMART.

218
00:12:20,947 --> 00:12:24,117
WELL, YOU MIGHT HAVE GOTTEN
THE UPPER HAND THIS ROUND,

219
00:12:24,117 --> 00:12:26,917
BUT THERE’S NO WAY IN HELL
YOU’RE GONNA BEAT ME!

220
00:12:26,917 --> 00:12:28,377
♪

221
00:12:28,377 --> 00:12:30,087
( growling )

222
00:12:30,087 --> 00:12:31,667
( roars )

223
00:12:35,177 --> 00:12:37,137
- ( Eugeo gasps )
- ( Bercouli chuckles )

224
00:12:40,177 --> 00:12:44,227
Eugeo: THE BLUE ROSE SWORD
HAS TWO DORMANT MEMORIES,

225
00:12:44,227 --> 00:12:47,017
ETERNAL ICE AND ROSE.

226
00:12:47,017 --> 00:12:51,227
WHEN I ACTIVATE ETERNAL ICE,
IT FREEZES EVERYTHING.

227
00:12:51,227 --> 00:12:53,527
NOW I’LL SHOW YOU
WHAT ROSE CAN DO.

228
00:12:55,197 --> 00:12:57,527
BLUE ROSE, BLOOM!

229
00:13:01,577 --> 00:13:03,827
( Bercouli gasps )
WHAT’D YOU DO?!

230
00:13:03,827 --> 00:13:06,747
Eugeo: THE ROSES BLOOM
BY ABSORBING THE LIFE

231
00:13:06,747 --> 00:13:08,627
OF THOSE TRAPPED IN THE ICE.

232
00:13:10,167 --> 00:13:11,287
Bercouli: DAMN IT.

233
00:13:11,287 --> 00:13:12,837
YOU LITTLE PUNK.

234
00:13:12,837 --> 00:13:15,217
SO WAS THIS YOUR PLAN ALL ALONG,

235
00:13:15,217 --> 00:13:16,257
KILLING THE BOTH OF US?!

236
00:13:16,257 --> 00:13:18,507
Eugeo: NOT US. JUST YOU.

237
00:13:18,507 --> 00:13:23,057
YOU HAVE AN ADVANTAGE OVER ME
IN EVERY WAY, EXCEPT ONE.

238
00:13:23,057 --> 00:13:25,387
IT’S YOUR TOTAL AMOUNT
OF LIFE LEFT.

239
00:13:25,387 --> 00:13:27,637
BASED ON YOUR APPEARANCE,

240
00:13:27,637 --> 00:13:30,557
YOU BECAME AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT
IN YOUR FORTIES,

241
00:13:30,557 --> 00:13:34,107
SO YOUR LIFE VALUE
IS LOWER THAN MINE.

242
00:13:34,107 --> 00:13:38,527
I’M YOUNGER, AND MY LIFE VALUE
IS NEAR ITS PEAK.

243
00:13:38,527 --> 00:13:40,527
EVEN THOUGH YOU LANDED A HIT,

244
00:13:40,527 --> 00:13:43,617
THE LIFE I HAVE LEFT
IS STILL HIGHER THAN YOURS.

245
00:13:43,617 --> 00:13:45,617
THAT’S WHAT I HOPED, ANYWAY.

246
00:13:45,617 --> 00:13:48,577
Bercouli: KID, YOU DON’T KNOW
WHAT YOU’RE TALKING ABOUT.

247
00:13:48,577 --> 00:13:52,667
YOU JUST SAID I "BECAME"
AN INTEGRITY KNIGHT.

248
00:13:52,667 --> 00:13:54,547
A KNIGHT’S ALL I’VE EVER BEEN.

249
00:13:54,547 --> 00:13:57,047
I DIDN’T HAVE A LIFE
BEFORE I WAS SUMMONED.

250
00:13:57,047 --> 00:13:59,927
Eugeo: AND THAT’S THE PART OF
YOU PEOPLE I FIND SO DESPICABLE!

251
00:13:59,927 --> 00:14:02,887
YOU’VE FORGOTTEN
WHO YOU USED TO BE.

252
00:14:02,887 --> 00:14:04,757
YOU’RE LOYAL TO THE AXIOM CHURCH

253
00:14:04,757 --> 00:14:06,767
WITHOUT KNOWING
WHAT IT REALLY IS.

254
00:14:06,767 --> 00:14:09,057
YOU ACT LIKE YOU’RE
CHAMPIONS OF JUSTICE,

255
00:14:09,057 --> 00:14:11,977
BUT YOU UPHOLD CORRUPTION!

256
00:14:11,977 --> 00:14:14,107
YOU THINK YOU’RE HERE
BECAUSE THE PONTIFEX

257
00:14:14,107 --> 00:14:16,817
SUMMONED YOU FROM HEAVEN,
BUT THAT’S A LIE!

258
00:14:16,817 --> 00:14:19,067
YOU HAD A MOTHER.

259
00:14:19,067 --> 00:14:21,027
SHE’S THE ONE
WHO GAVE YOU THE NAME BERCOULI.

260
00:14:21,027 --> 00:14:23,197
YOU’RE HUMAN, JUST LIKE ME!

261
00:14:23,197 --> 00:14:24,737
( gasps )

262
00:14:24,737 --> 00:14:28,827
BERCOULI. IN MY VILLAGE,
THEY TELL STORIES

263
00:14:28,827 --> 00:14:30,867
ABOUT HOW MUCH
OF A HERO YOU WERE.

264
00:14:30,867 --> 00:14:33,837
( Bercouli gasps )
WHAT STORIES?

265
00:14:33,837 --> 00:14:35,627
Eugeo: THINK BACK.

266
00:14:35,627 --> 00:14:38,047
I’M SURE YOU’VE
SEEN THIS SWORD BEFORE.

267
00:14:40,627 --> 00:14:43,257
Bercouli:
YEAH, I HAVE, SOMEWHERE.

268
00:14:43,257 --> 00:14:46,427
RIGHT. YEARS AGO...

269
00:14:46,427 --> 00:14:49,477
IT WAS IN THE NEST
OF THE WHITE DRAGON.

270
00:14:49,477 --> 00:14:51,477
I SAW IT THERE
AFTER I KILLED IT.

271
00:14:51,477 --> 00:14:53,727
Eugeo: YOU KILLED THE DRAGON?

272
00:14:55,067 --> 00:14:57,227
I SAW ITS BONES...

273
00:14:57,227 --> 00:15:03,237
AND NOW--NOW YOU SAY
THE ONE WHO KILLED IT WAS YOU?

274
00:15:03,237 --> 00:15:06,487
A DRAGON
THAT PROTECTED THE HUMAN REALM,

275
00:15:06,487 --> 00:15:08,697
THE ONE FROM YOUR OWN LEGEND.

276
00:15:08,697 --> 00:15:11,867
DON’T YOU REMEMBER
ANYTHING ABOUT YOUR PAST,

277
00:15:11,867 --> 00:15:14,207
ABOUT WHO YOU WERE?

278
00:15:14,207 --> 00:15:17,997
IN RULID, THE VILLAGE YOU
FOUNDED AND WHERE I WAS BORN,

279
00:15:17,997 --> 00:15:19,587
EVERYONE KNEW ABOUT YOU.

280
00:15:19,587 --> 00:15:22,547
YOUNG OR OLD,
WE LOOKED UP TO YOU AS A HERO.

281
00:15:22,547 --> 00:15:25,927
BUT THE PONTIFEX
SEALED AWAY YOUR MEMORIES.

282
00:15:25,927 --> 00:15:30,347
SHE TURNED YOU
INTO THE FIRST INTEGRITY KNIGHT.

283
00:15:30,347 --> 00:15:32,097
THEN CAME THE OTHERS,

284
00:15:32,097 --> 00:15:36,897
EVERYONE FROM FANATIO TO ELDRIE,
EVEN ALICE,

285
00:15:36,897 --> 00:15:38,817
ALL OF YOU.

286
00:15:38,817 --> 00:15:42,237
BEFORE YOU BECAME
INTEGRITY KNIGHTS,

287
00:15:42,237 --> 00:15:43,237
YOU HAD LIVES.

288
00:15:43,237 --> 00:15:45,027
YOU WERE HUMAN.

289
00:15:45,027 --> 00:15:49,037
Bercouli:
SEALED AWAY MY MEMORIES?

290
00:15:49,037 --> 00:15:55,037
I CAN’T JUST BELIEVE
A WILD STORY LIKE THAT.

291
00:15:55,037 --> 00:15:58,747
BUT ALL THAT STUFF I WAS TOLD

292
00:15:58,747 --> 00:16:02,337
ABOUT ME BEING SUMMONED
FROM HEAVEN,

293
00:16:02,337 --> 00:16:06,297
I HAD MY DOUBTS FOR A WHILE NOW.

294
00:16:06,297 --> 00:16:08,387
( Eugeo shudders )

295
00:16:13,597 --> 00:16:16,147
- ( bouncing )
- ( laughing )

296
00:16:16,147 --> 00:16:18,017
♪

297
00:16:23,607 --> 00:16:27,867
Man: WELL, WELL!
NOW, WHAT DO WE HAVE HERE?

298
00:16:29,077 --> 00:16:30,077
( chuckles )

299
00:16:30,077 --> 00:16:32,867
( laughing )

300
00:16:33,957 --> 00:16:36,457
THIS WON’T DO. NO, NO, NO.

301
00:16:36,457 --> 00:16:39,457
THIS WON’T DO AT ALL,
MY DEAR COMMANDER.

302
00:16:39,457 --> 00:16:44,087
SURELY, GOOD SIR, YOU DON’T PLAN
TO DIE ON US LIKE THIS?

303
00:16:44,087 --> 00:16:47,087
THAT WOULD BE TREASON
AGAINST HER EMINENCE,

304
00:16:47,087 --> 00:16:49,847
THE LOVELY PONTIFEX.

305
00:16:49,847 --> 00:16:52,177
IF SHE WERE AWAKE
TO SEE YOU IN THIS STATE,

306
00:16:52,177 --> 00:16:53,637
SHE WOULD BE LIVID.

307
00:16:53,637 --> 00:16:57,437
Bercouli:
PRIME SENATOR CHUDELKIN,

308
00:16:57,437 --> 00:17:00,727
THIS IS A FIGHT
BETWEEN SWORDSMEN.

309
00:17:00,727 --> 00:17:04,027
A PIG LIKE YOU
HAS NO BUSINESS HERE.

310
00:17:04,027 --> 00:17:05,987
Chudelkin: HA HA HA!

311
00:17:05,987 --> 00:17:09,157
AFTER GOING SO EASY
ON THIS HERETIC,

312
00:17:09,157 --> 00:17:11,737
YOU HAVE NO BUSINESS
CORRECTING ME.

313
00:17:11,737 --> 00:17:14,577
DEAR COMMANDER, PRAY TELL,

314
00:17:14,577 --> 00:17:17,417
WHY DID YOU NOT USE
YOUR SWORD’S FULL POWER?

315
00:17:17,417 --> 00:17:20,707
IF YOU HAD, YOU COULD HAVE
SLAUGHTERED THIS LOATHSOME BRAT

316
00:17:20,707 --> 00:17:22,997
BEFORE HE OPENED
HIS SLANDEROUS LITTLE MOUTH.

317
00:17:22,997 --> 00:17:25,337
BUT YOU DID NOT, AND, THEREFORE,

318
00:17:25,337 --> 00:17:27,717
COMMITTED TREASON
AGAINST THE GLORIOUS PONTIFEX.

319
00:17:27,717 --> 00:17:29,887
- Bercouli: SHUT YOUR MOUTH.
- ( Chudelkin gasps )

320
00:17:29,887 --> 00:17:34,017
Bercouli: I FOUGHT
WITH EVERYTHING I HAD.

321
00:17:35,387 --> 00:17:37,597
BUT YOU LIED TO ME.

322
00:17:37,597 --> 00:17:40,687
YOU LIED TO ALL OF US.

323
00:17:40,687 --> 00:17:46,487
THIS KID AIN’T NO ASSASSIN
FROM THE DARK TERRITORY.

324
00:17:46,487 --> 00:17:50,197
AND COMPARED TO AN UGLY
PIECE OF SHIT LIKE YOU--

325
00:17:50,197 --> 00:17:51,447
Chudelkin: SILENCE!

326
00:17:51,447 --> 00:17:53,577
BE SILENT, OR I’LL
RIP OFF YOUR HEAD!

327
00:17:55,497 --> 00:17:57,747
FOR YOUR INFORMATION, MY DEAR,

328
00:17:57,747 --> 00:17:59,667
WE WOULDN’T HAVE THIS PROBLEM

329
00:17:59,667 --> 00:18:02,707
IF YOU DAMNED KNIGHTS
WEREN’T SO DAMNED USELESS.

330
00:18:02,707 --> 00:18:05,667
HONESTLY,
WHEN HER EMINENCE AWAKES,

331
00:18:05,667 --> 00:18:08,417
YOU KNIGHTS WILL BE
THOROUGHLY PUNISHED.

332
00:18:08,417 --> 00:18:10,757
AT THE VERY LEAST, YOU AND
YOUR PRECIOUS VICE COMMANDER

333
00:18:10,757 --> 00:18:12,717
SHALL BE REPROCESSED.

334
00:18:12,717 --> 00:18:14,597
Bercouli: "RE-" WHAT?

335
00:18:14,597 --> 00:18:17,097
YOU’RE TALKIN’ OUT
YOUR ASS AGAIN.

336
00:18:17,097 --> 00:18:18,347
( Chudelkin chuckles )

337
00:18:18,347 --> 00:18:21,267
SYSTEM CALL! DEEP FREEZE!

338
00:18:21,267 --> 00:18:26,107
INTEGRATOR UNIT I.D.
ZERO-ZERO-ONE!

339
00:18:30,147 --> 00:18:31,987
( Bercouli gasps )

340
00:18:35,077 --> 00:18:35,947
( Eugeo gasping )

341
00:18:38,287 --> 00:18:40,867
( Chudelkin laughs )

342
00:18:40,867 --> 00:18:43,497
WE DON’T NEED
OLD FARTS LIKE NUMBER ONE

343
00:18:43,497 --> 00:18:45,877
STINKING UP THE PLACE ANYMORE.

344
00:18:45,877 --> 00:18:48,047
NOW WE HAVE A MUCH YOUNGER,

345
00:18:48,047 --> 00:18:49,667
- MORE USEFUL PAWN...
- Eugeo: KIRITO.

346
00:18:49,667 --> 00:18:51,547
Chudelkin: AT OUR DISPOSAL.

347
00:18:51,547 --> 00:18:53,087
Eugeo: ALICE.

348
00:18:55,387 --> 00:18:56,927
Kirito: EUGEO.

349
00:18:56,927 --> 00:18:58,807
Alice: IS SOMETHING THE MATTER?

350
00:18:58,807 --> 00:19:01,387
Kirito: HUH? OH, NO. NOTHING.

351
00:19:01,387 --> 00:19:03,227
AS SOON AS THE MOON COMES OUT,

352
00:19:03,227 --> 00:19:05,817
I THINK WE CAN START
CLIMBING UP THE WALL AGAIN.

353
00:19:05,817 --> 00:19:07,397
LONG AS I CAN MAKE SPIKES,

354
00:19:07,397 --> 00:19:09,487
IT SHOULD GO PRETTY EASY
FROM HERE ON.

355
00:19:09,487 --> 00:19:11,697
THERE’S NO MINIONS ABOVE US,

356
00:19:11,697 --> 00:19:14,027
AND THE OTHERS HERE
AIN’T WAKING UP.

357
00:19:14,027 --> 00:19:16,947
FOR NOW. BESIDES THE LACK
OF SACRED POWER,

358
00:19:16,947 --> 00:19:19,447
THE ONLY OTHER BIG PROBLEM
IS FOOD.

359
00:19:19,447 --> 00:19:21,657
I DON’T KNOW ABOUT YOU,
BUT I’M STARVING.

360
00:19:21,657 --> 00:19:23,827
IF I THINK ABOUT
HOW MUCH FURTHER WE GOTTA GO,

361
00:19:23,827 --> 00:19:25,587
MY HEAD STARTS SPINNING.

362
00:19:25,587 --> 00:19:28,337
Alice: COULD YOU BE
ANY MORE OF A DISAPPOINTMENT?

363
00:19:28,337 --> 00:19:29,507
Kirito: WHAT?!

364
00:19:29,507 --> 00:19:31,377
Alice: WHETHER WE MISS
A MEAL OR TWO

365
00:19:31,377 --> 00:19:34,467
IS THE LEAST OF OUR WORRIES,
UNLESS YOU ARE A CHILD.

366
00:19:34,467 --> 00:19:37,057
Kirito: YEAH, WELL,
TECHNICALLY, I STILL SORT OF AM.

367
00:19:37,057 --> 00:19:39,267
I MIGHT NOT ACT
LIKE IT ALL THE TIME,

368
00:19:39,267 --> 00:19:41,517
BUT I’M NOT EVEN
OUT OF MY TEENS YET.

369
00:19:41,517 --> 00:19:43,597
I DON’T EAT, MY LIFE GOES DOWN,

370
00:19:43,597 --> 00:19:45,437
A PROBLEM
YOU BADASS KNIGHTS DON’T HAVE.

371
00:19:45,437 --> 00:19:47,067
Alice: SUCH LANGUAGE!

372
00:19:47,067 --> 00:19:49,397
EVEN INTEGRITY KNIGHTS
GET HUNGRY.

373
00:19:49,397 --> 00:19:51,937
WE MUST EAT,
OR WE LOSE LIFE LIKE YOU.

374
00:19:51,937 --> 00:19:53,607
- ( stomach grumbles )
- ( both gasp )

375
00:19:55,447 --> 00:19:56,447
( Kirito snickers )

376
00:19:56,447 --> 00:19:57,827
WHOA! HOLD ON!

377
00:19:57,827 --> 00:19:59,657
SORRY! I WAS KIDDING!

378
00:19:59,657 --> 00:20:03,657
OF COURSE YOU GET HUNGRY.
YOU’RE AS ALIVE AS ANYONE ELSE.

379
00:20:03,657 --> 00:20:06,707
SPEAKIN’ OF FOOD,
WHERE ARE CARDINAL’S SNACKS?

380
00:20:06,707 --> 00:20:08,337
Alice: HMM?

381
00:20:08,337 --> 00:20:11,417
Kirito: AW, YEAH.
I KNEW I SNAGGED SOME MORE.

382
00:20:11,417 --> 00:20:12,587
LOOKIT! IT’S DINNERTIME!

383
00:20:12,587 --> 00:20:14,427
♪

384
00:20:14,427 --> 00:20:15,967
Alice: WHY IN THE WORLD

385
00:20:15,967 --> 00:20:18,807
WOULD YOU STORE YOUR FOOD
IN SUCH A WAY?

386
00:20:18,807 --> 00:20:21,517
Kirito: I DON’T. I JUST TAPPED
MY POCKET, AND THERE THEY WERE.

387
00:20:21,517 --> 00:20:23,387
TRY IT SOMETIME.

388
00:20:23,387 --> 00:20:25,437
BUT FIRST I GOTTA
GET THESE READY TO EAT.

389
00:20:25,437 --> 00:20:26,727
( chuckles )

390
00:20:26,727 --> 00:20:27,807
( Alice groans )

391
00:20:27,807 --> 00:20:29,607
Kirito: SYSTEM CALL.

392
00:20:29,607 --> 00:20:31,647
GENERATE THERMAL ELEMENT.

393
00:20:31,647 --> 00:20:32,647
BURST ELE--

394
00:20:32,647 --> 00:20:33,857
Alice: NO, YOU FOOL!

395
00:20:33,857 --> 00:20:35,527
Kirito: WHAT?

396
00:20:35,527 --> 00:20:37,697
Alice: IF YOU USE THAT ART,
YOU WILL BURN THEM!

397
00:20:37,697 --> 00:20:39,407
Kirito: SORRY.

398
00:20:39,407 --> 00:20:41,037
( gasps )

399
00:20:43,827 --> 00:20:46,327
Alice: GENERATE THERMAL ELEMENT,

400
00:20:46,327 --> 00:20:47,917
AQUEOUS ELEMENT,

401
00:20:47,917 --> 00:20:49,747
AERIAL ELEMENT.

402
00:20:51,547 --> 00:20:54,417
VORTEX SHAPE. BURST.

403
00:20:55,757 --> 00:20:57,467
( steam hissing )

404
00:20:57,467 --> 00:20:59,217
Kirito: WHOA!

405
00:20:59,217 --> 00:21:00,387
HURRY! GIMME ONE!

406
00:21:00,387 --> 00:21:01,807
( Alice chuckles )

407
00:21:01,807 --> 00:21:03,307
Kirito: WAIT! NO, NO, NO!

408
00:21:03,307 --> 00:21:04,177
Alice: I AM JOKING.

409
00:21:05,517 --> 00:21:07,227
( Kirito chuckles )

410
00:21:07,227 --> 00:21:09,147
( blows )

411
00:21:10,227 --> 00:21:11,687
MMM.

412
00:21:11,687 --> 00:21:13,567
THAT HIT THE SPOT.

413
00:21:13,567 --> 00:21:14,897
THANKS FOR SHOWING ME THAT.

414
00:21:14,897 --> 00:21:16,697
I DIDN’T KNOW
YOU COULD STEAM FOOD

415
00:21:16,697 --> 00:21:18,277
USING ELEMENTS
INSTEAD OF A PAN.

416
00:21:18,277 --> 00:21:20,987
DID YOU TEACH
YOUR LITTLE SIS HOW TO COOK?

417
00:21:20,987 --> 00:21:22,657
’CAUSE SELKA’S
REALLY GOOD AT IT.

418
00:21:22,657 --> 00:21:24,037
( gasps )

419
00:21:24,037 --> 00:21:25,867
Alice: WHAT DID
YOU SAY JUST NOW?

420
00:21:25,867 --> 00:21:27,207
( Kirito gasps )

421
00:21:28,577 --> 00:21:30,747
THAT YOU HAVE A LITTLE SISTER.

422
00:21:30,747 --> 00:21:33,457
HER NAME’S SELKA.

423
00:21:33,457 --> 00:21:34,417
Alice: SISTER?

424
00:21:36,297 --> 00:21:38,677
♪

425
00:21:38,677 --> 00:21:40,427
( gasps )

426
00:21:40,427 --> 00:21:42,557
Kirito: I CAN
TELL YOU ABOUT HER.

427
00:21:42,557 --> 00:21:46,227
I CAN TELL YOU EVERYTHING
I KNOW ABOUT THIS PLACE.

428
00:21:46,227 --> 00:21:48,307
I DON’T KNOW
IF YOU’LL BELIEVE ME,

429
00:21:48,307 --> 00:21:49,307
BUT IT’S WORTH A SHOT.

430
00:21:50,897 --> 00:21:52,357
( Alice sighs )

431
00:21:52,357 --> 00:21:54,777
GO ON, THEN.

432
00:21:54,777 --> 00:21:56,437
HOWEVER...

433
00:21:56,437 --> 00:22:00,567
IF I DETECT EVEN
A TRACE OF DECEIT IN YOUR WORDS,

434
00:22:00,567 --> 00:22:03,277
I SHALL END YOUR LIFE.

435
00:22:03,277 --> 00:22:04,287
( Kirito gasps )

436
00:22:06,157 --> 00:22:09,577
Singer: ♪ OH, EVERYTHING
TURNS TO ASH, TO ASH ♪

437
00:22:09,577 --> 00:22:11,247
( singing in Japanese )

438
00:22:19,127 --> 00:22:22,597
♪ AND EVERYTHING
TURNS TO DUST, TO DUST ♪

439
00:22:22,597 --> 00:22:24,257
( singing in Japanese )

440
00:22:32,017 --> 00:22:34,227
♪ FORGET-ME-NOT ♪

